// 程序输出窗口：启动一个程序，显示它的文本、二维图形和三维场景。程序本身是独立进程。
include "/System/lib/ui.nest";

let PROG = "";
let PID = 0;
let LINES = [];
let STATE = "启动中";
let STATS = "";
let DRAW = null;
let SCENE_LOADED = false;
let VID = "";
let SCROLL_END = true;

function add_line(t) {
  let parts = split(t, "\n");
  for (let p of parts) push(LINES, p);
  while (len(LINES) > 400) shift(LINES);
  ui_invalidate();
}
function render(v) {
  let W = v.w, H = v.h;
  let out = [];
  push(out, T("t", 10, 6, W - 240, 26, "panel-title small", PROG));
  push(out, T("s", W - 228, 6, 110, 26, "state-text", STATE));
  push(out, B("sp", W - 114, 6, 50, 26, "结束", "kill", null, { cls: "small", dis: PID == 0 || STATE != "运行中", tid: "console-kill" }));
  push(out, B("rs", W - 60, 6, 50, 26, "重跑", "rerun", null, { cls: "small", tid: "console-rerun" }));
  let top = 38;
  let gh = 0;
  if (SCENE_LOADED) {
    gh = floor((H - top) * 0.62);
    push(out, { k: "v3d", t: "view3d", vid: VID, x: 8, y: top, w: W - 16, h: gh, cls: "view3d" });
  } else if (DRAW != null) {
    gh = floor((H - top) * 0.62);
    push(out, { k: "draw", t: "draw", x: 8, y: top, w: W - 16, h: gh, ops: DRAW, cls: "draw-area" });
  }
  let ty = top + (gh > 0 ? gh + 6 : 0);
  let th = H - ty - 8;
  let maxl = floor(th / 18);
  let start = len(LINES) - maxl;
  if (start < 0) start = 0;
  let body = [];
  let i = start;
  while (i < len(LINES)) { push(body, LINES[i]); i = i + 1; }
  push(out, { k: "out", x: 8, y: ty, w: W - 16, h: th, cls: "console-out", text: join(body, "\n"), tid: "console-output" });
  return out;
}
function start_program() {
  LINES = [];
  DRAW = null;
  STATE = "启动中";
  ui_invalidate();
  ui_refresh();
  let r = spawn(PROG, { console: self().pid }, { stdout: self().pid, name: base_of(PROG), kind: "user" });
  if (is_err(r)) {
    STATE = "启动失败";
    add_line(r.error);
    PID = 0;
    return;
  }
  PID = r;
  STATE = "运行中";
  ui_invalidate();
}
function on_act(v, act, data, ev) {
  if (act == "kill") { if (PID != 0) sys("kill", PID); return; }
  if (act == "rerun") { if (PID != 0) sys("kill", PID); start_program(); return; }
}
function on_msg(m) {
  let d = m.data;
  let t = d.type;
  if (t == "print") add_line(d.text);
  else if (t == "draw") { DRAW = d.ops; ui_invalidate(); }
  else if (t == "scene") {
    let r = sys("gfx_open", VID, d.text);
    if (is_err(r)) add_line("三维场景载入失败：" + r.error);
    else {
      SCENE_LOADED = true;
      if (d.frame != null) sys("gfx_frame", VID, d.frame);
      ui_invalidate();
    }
  } else if (t == "scene_frame") { if (SCENE_LOADED) sys("gfx_frame", VID, d.frame); }
  else if (t == "proc_end") {
    if (d.pid == PID) {
      STATE = d.state == "fault" ? "异常结束" : "已结束";
      if (d.state == "fault") add_line("异常：" + str(d.error));
      else if (d.value != null) add_line("结果：" + str(d.value));
      ui_invalidate();
    }
  }
}
function main(args) {
  PROG = args.program;
  app_window(base_of(PROG) + " — 程序输出", "console", 620, 420, "console");
  VID = UI_MAIN.sid + "v";
  start_program();
  app_run({ render: render, act: on_act, msg: on_msg }, null);
}
